<section image-layout="blank" id="PcsKKeIAM7"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="VMGbYYLq_P"><labels><label variant="solid">Interpretive claim</label></labels><h2>Realism: a social world closes in</h2><p font-size="18pt">The poem exposes a recurring system: different actors appear, but money, procedure, and gendered judgment keep narrowing Kiều’s available choices.</p><freeform-block w="840" h="232"><shape preset="line" x="250" y="49" w="50" h="50" stroke="accent" stroke-width="2"></shape><shape preset="line" x="250" y="133" w="50" h="50" flip-v="true" stroke="accent" stroke-width="2"></shape><shape preset="line" x="540" y="49" w="50" h="50" flip-h="true" stroke="accent" stroke-width="2"></shape><shape preset="line" x="540" y="133" w="50" h="50" stroke="accent" stroke-width="2"></shape><box type="content" x="12" y="2" w="238" h="94" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 8pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid var(--neutral-border-color); border-radius: 4pt;"><h4>Money</h4><p font-size="14pt">Family crisis becomes a market for Kiều’s body.</p></box><box type="content" x="12" y="136" w="238" h="94" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 8pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid var(--neutral-border-color); border-radius: 4pt;"><h4>Official procedure</h4><p font-size="14pt">Coercion and betrayal acquire lawful language.</p></box><box type="content" x="590" y="2" w="238" h="94" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 8pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid var(--neutral-border-color); border-radius: 4pt;"><h4>Gendered judgment</h4><p font-size="14pt">Female reputation is policed more harshly.</p></box><box type="content" x="590" y="136" w="238" h="94" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 8pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid var(--neutral-border-color); border-radius: 4pt;"><h4>Repeated reversals</h4><p font-size="14pt">New actors reproduce the pressure.</p></box><box type="content" x="300" y="80" w="240" h="72" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="accent" style="padding: 7pt 12pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><h4 align="center">Kiều’s available choices</h4></box></freeform-block><p font-size="18pt"><b>Different actors; the same narrowing social logic.</b></p></grid-item></grid></section>